							<Item class="Script" referent="RBXb283df1e8364470b811e8a8e04c2ff5e">
								<Properties>
									<ProtectedString name="Source"><![CDATA[--Hello and thank you for using Rengate's boat scripts. Here are some simple instructions for the settings.
--MaxSpeed: This is the top speed of you boat. 0-inf
--Acceleration: The rate at which you want your boat to accelerate. 0.1-1
--TurnSpeed: The rate at which you want your boat to turn. 0.01-.5

--Thanks again and hope they work well]]></ProtectedString>
